🎧 Moodboard — Your Feelings, Your Soundtrack

What if your mood had its own soundtrack?

Moodboard is a small, interactive web development project that connects moods, music, and aesthetics in one place.

✨ Features

- 🎭 Choose from 9 different moods
- 🎵 Get random song recommendations based on your selected mood
- 💬 Discover mood-specific quotes
- 🎨 Explore a dark, aesthetic interface with mood-based gradients
- ▶️ Search for recommended songs directly on YouTube
- 📱 Responsive layout for mobile and desktop screens

🛠️ Built With

- HTML5
- CSS3
- Vanilla JavaScript

🚀 Run Locally

1. Clone or download this repository.
2. Open "index.html" in your browser.
3. Select a mood and explore your soundtrack.

No additional libraries or build tools are required.

